{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_13_level_main_13-12_end",
  "groupId": "main_13",
  "stageId": "main_13-12",
  "title": "猩紅煙火",
  "storyCode": "13-14",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-12_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c86eb5993d831a3df05372b53040cd1d8b7d19b163e00ac53172ff21718eef5e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍尉官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你昨晚沒有把東西送到我的營帳……瑪格達爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍尉官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你也沒有離開布倫特伍德鎮，可悲的選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍尉官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為什麼不離開？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪格達爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這裡是我的家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪格達爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是有新的訂單嗎？我可以連昨天的花一併送過去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍尉官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……你今後不用再為那些訂單操心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍尉官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是來向你告別的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍尉官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我即將前往食腐者之王閣下的軍團中……作戰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪格達爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪格達爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好吧……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪格達爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "再見。如果這是你想聽到的問候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍尉官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……你太單純，單純到近乎愚蠢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍尉官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我一直試圖保護一些東西，但是它們卻總是自取滅亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍尉官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也許我一開始就錯了，瑪格達爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪格達爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我聽不懂你在說什麼，“鍬子”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍尉官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我曾無比羨慕你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍尉官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "維多利亞過去是高貴而又強大的國家，你們理所當然地佔據了太多好東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍尉官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們靠著發達的冶金學和蒸汽騎士征服了另一個帝國，靠著迷人的藝術和豐富的學術吸引了全泰拉的天才……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍尉官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而如今，你們停下了向外征服的腳步。你們的統治者，流連於酒宴上的紅酒杯，吹噓著胸前勳章的虛名。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍尉官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "榮光被親自掐滅，被取代的命運也早已注定——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍尉官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？這個掛鐘你還留著……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍尉官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "時間過得真快，鎮上的人應該都出發去工地了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪格達爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍尉官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……你們的死亡無法避免，瑪格達爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍尉官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大君很不耐煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍尉官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以儀式被要求提前了，而你們在那個菲林的帶領下，確實超額完成了任務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍尉官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這裡的人都會是開啟儀式的鑰匙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍尉官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當然，也包括你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蕾達",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……剛剛在薩卡茲的軍營裡，威爾被那些魔族佬留下了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪格達爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "芙蕾達……你看到了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪格達爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……我得去找芙蕾達！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪格達爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放開我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍尉官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不能離開這間溫室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍尉官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "再等等吧，瑪格達爾，我會陪著你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍尉官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等著我們最後的告別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪格達爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為什麼……鎮上的人從來沒有違背過你們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪格達爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "芙蕾達帶著全鎮的人滿足了你們的所有要求！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍尉官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "殿下決定了這場戰爭，你們的公爵響應了這場戰爭。這個結果與我們，或是你們都無關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍尉官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們只需要服從命令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪格達爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那讓我去警告工地上的人！就像以前一樣，你當作什麼都不知道，求你了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍尉官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍尉官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我為殿下效命，我不會允許你破壞儀式……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍尉官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……除非你能越過我，瑪格達爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "王庭軍尉官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你能做到嗎，“園丁”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疑惑的市民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "瑪格達爾，你急匆匆的要去哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疑惑的市民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你衣服上的血……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪格達爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……沒事——修剪枝芽時不小心剪破了手指……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪格達爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "漢克，芙蕾達在哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疑惑的市民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "芙蕾達？她早上一個人從軍營那邊回來之後，就去找那些薩卡茲長官了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疑惑的市民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她看上去失魂落魄的，看見誰都說對不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疑惑的市民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是發生什麼事了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪格達爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……快讓大家趕緊遠離這個地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪格達爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "越遠越好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疑惑的市民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們今天怎麼一個比一個奇怪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪格達爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "來不及解釋了，我得去通知其他人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疑惑的市民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可我們馬上就要建完了呀？再說，要是我們曠工，被那些長官抓住怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疑惑的市民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "煙火？哪來的煙火？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疑惑的市民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "誰把那堵牆炸開了？那是……芙蕾達？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐懼的市民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "發生什麼事了？地震了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐懼的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "快……快逃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐懼的市民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在流血……該死，不要過來！那些噁心的怪物正從你身上掉下來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪格達爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "薩卡茲到底想幹嘛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪格達爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "漢克，漢克！你不能閉上眼睛……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪格達爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我……也感覺好累……好睏……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "瑪格達爾！堅持住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "隊長，我抓住她了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所有人注意！抓穩滑索，不要接觸地面！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "趕緊救人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "瑪格達爾小姐，現在還不能睡哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪格達爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "洛洛小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這傢伙可真沉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "昏迷的市民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪格達爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "費斯特先生……自救軍……怎麼會？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們看到鎮裡大白天放煙火就猜到出事了！我們昨天打開的缺口被封上了，但你們的那門禮炮炸出了新的路線。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抓緊洛洛的手，瑪格達爾！我們的戰鬥部隊不足，只能先帶著大家盡快撤退！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喔哦！費斯特，你改良後的滑索速度好像更快了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對了，芙蕾達鎮長在哪？我們沒找到她的位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪格達爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……芙蕾達她——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "該死，我的滑索怎麼開始抖起來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
